20
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:25,250
Six seconds from Face ID to paid, in the Airwallex sandbox.

21
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:27,650
That is the transfer id.

22
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:29,750
Look it up yourself.

23
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:34,450
